@RUN   ALBANY,76104,CS301,1,20
@APL,I
$CM A SINE WAVE PLOTTED ON THE LINE PRINTER, A STAR TO EACH POINT
X $AL 0.25$MU$IO 50
$CM H IS EACH POINT'S ROW, 5 TO $NG5; R IS EVERY ROW, TOP TO BOTTOM
H $AL $FL 0.5+5$MU 1$CI X
R $AL 6-$IO 11
$CM A STAR WHERE THE CURVE IS, A DASH ALONG THE AXIS, ELSE A BLANK
M $AL (2$MU R$SO.=H)$CE(R=0)$SO.$OR 0$MU H
' -*'$LB 1+M$RB
@FIN
